  "locale": "en",
  "returnFrequency": "QUARTERLY",
  "description": "Template for SACCOs and Tier 4 microfinance institutions. Regulatory minimums and maximums from the Tier 4 Microfinance Institutions and Money Lenders Act 2016 (liquid assets, s.5 and s.46) and the UMRA SACCO regulations: liquidity at least 15% of savings and short-term liabilities, core capital at least 10% of total assets, non-earning assets at most 10% of total assets, external borrowing at most 25% of total assets, non-government securities at most 40% of core capital; returns quarterly. PLACEHOLDERS: every GL component, the call money term and the warnings; map them before activating.",
